OL,3,GNEWSA'I still saved #4,000' - mum calls
OL,4,Afor school holiday fine change'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA single mother has said she saved
OL,7,Fnearly #4,000 by taking her children on
OL,8,Fholiday during term time, and called
OL,9,Ffor reform to the system of fines
OL,10,Fbrought against her and other parents
OL,11,Famid what she labelled a travel
OL,12,Findustry "price trap".
OL,14,FKashmir, from Willenhall in Walsall,
OL,15,Fwas fined twice for family trips to
OL,16,FFlorida and Mexico, and said she had
OL,17,Fbeen made to feel "like a criminal when
OL,18,FI'm only trying to do the best for my
OL,19,Fchildren".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
