OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'I still saved #4,000' - mum calls
OL,4,Afor school holiday fine change'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer comments came after BBC analysis
OL,7,Ffound that the number of fines issued
OL,8,Fto families across the West Midlands
OL,9,Ffor taking children out of school
OL,10,Fduring term time had almost doubled in
OL,11,Ffive years.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,352,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F351A1790679343
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSA'I still saved #4,000' - mum calls
OL,4,Afor school holiday fine change'
OL,5,
OL,6,FKashmir, 47, said "it's really
OL,7,Fdifficult" for working families to go
OL,8,Fon holiday during official school break
OL,9,Fperiods as there was a premium, set by
OL,10,Fthe travel industry, on doing so.
OL,11,FLeaders in education, however, have
OL,12,Fargued that missing school can have a
OL,13,Fsignificant impact on pupils, with head
OL,14,Fteachers left feeling like "bad guys"
OL,15,Fin the middle of a stand off between
OL,16,Fholiday operators and families looking
OL,17,Fto save money.
